# Environment: test — branch `test`
#
# test IS applied to the cluster (namespace ha-test) but Home Assistant runs at
# replicas: 0. That gives real server-side validation — admission control,
# schema, CRDs — at essentially zero CPU/RAM cost, which is what makes a
# three-environment model viable on a 6 GiB thin client.
#
# Scale to 1 by hand for a temporary smoke test, then back to 0. See docs/lcm.md.
#
# TRACKED IN GIT — never put secrets in this file.

